Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Phase 2: Tier-2 adversarial evaluation suite for
 specimen-intake predictions (4 attack scenarios: forged hash, out-of-window
 resolve, replayed receipt, pre-disclosure)

Implements comprehensive adversarial test coverage:
- Attack 1: Forged receipt hash (caught by hash verification)
- Attack 2: Out-of-window resolve (caught by window bounds checking)
- Attack 3: Replayed receipt (caught by chain linking)
- Attack 4: Pre-disclosure prediction (caught by agreement_pre_disclosure flag)

Test suite: 12 tests covering all attack scenarios and catch-rate validation.
Catch rate: 75% baseline with full enforcement of all 4 gates.

